      "id": "claim_11d910894cc94758ac421cc7f40d5cbd",
      "statement": "Sharing has two mechanisms: collaborators (with build/use roles) and share links whose raw 128-bit keys are never stored — only their HMAC-SHA-256 hashes are, and a link is stored as its first key (the hash is the link id) with copies as alias keys.",
