    {
      "id": "claim_680d2699453e4b46aa6fcfef0eecac11",
      "statement": "Authorization is a permission graph: each collaborator has user/share-link edges, and effective role is the maximum role reachable from the owner (the implicit build root) where each edge grants min(edge role, sharer's effective role), computed live by computeEffectiveRoles via a fixed-point iteration that terminates because roles only increase.",
      "evidence": [
