      "id": "claim_22b333ec224f41c792a04d39120a8b23",
      "statement": "Revocation is two-phase: preview methods run computeEffectiveRoles with a hypothetical change (removedUser/removedEdge/revokedLinkId) and return the AffectedCollaborators whose access would change, then the confirm call performs the lazy severance; keepUsers re-roots spared dependents with a fresh edge from the caller at their prior role.",
