      "statement": "open() computes the caller's effective role and hands back different capabilities: full OverseerClientInterface for build/owner, and a UseOverseerInterface that implements Overseer but throws Unauthorized for everything outside the use allowlist (default-deny by construction), with share-key redemption happening atomically in the same call.",
