      "id": "claim_2b83a6f4ffe64685b9dfa123b10a96aa",
      "statement": "ensureObserver runs at every open: it selects in-scope gatekeepers by role (build = all, use = named bindings only), fills ambient bindings from the collaborator's own provided accounts, invokes the ObserverConfigCallback only for uncovered bindings, verifies each choice server-side (getVerifier throws on vendor mismatch) via addObserver, re-prompts once on failure, and persists the observer record only after all addObserver calls succeed.",
